post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
The systemd user unit is installed but deliberately not enabled:

  systemctl --user enable --now pw-mpris-visualcard

It publishes a PipeWire video node named "pw-mpris-visualcard" (460x690, 30 fps,
3 lyric lines). Select that node from OBS with the obs-pwvideo plugin; the
linux-pipewire plugin shipped with OBS goes through xdg-desktop-portal and cannot
see this kind of node.

Options are the ExecStart arguments of the unit, e.g.

  systemctl --user edit pw-mpris-visualcard     # override ExecStart=
  pw-mpris-visualcard-native --help             # full list

`--size` must match the source resolution configured in OBS, `--node` must match
the name picked there.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
